<title>UK: Japan Finance Corp mandates 450 mln mark Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Japan Finance Corp mandates 450 mln mark Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Finance Corp for Small Businesses has mandated Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell to underwrite a 450 million mark Eurobond, the lead managers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal will have a five-year maturity.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
